{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2022-12-07 18:07:00', 'title': 'GENERAC SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT PENDING: CONTACT LEVI & KORSINSKY BEFORE JANUARY 30, 2023 TO DISCUSS YOUR RIGHTS - GNRC', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - DECEMBER 7, 2022) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. ("GENERAC" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: GNRC) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF GENERAC INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE EASTERN DISTRICT OF WISCONSIN. THIS LAWSUIT IS ON BEHALF OF ALL INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED GENERAC HOLDINGS INC.'}{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2022-12-07 15:48:00', 'title': 'GENERAC INVESTORS: 1/30/23 FILING DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION – CONTACT LIEFF CABRASER', 'text': 'SAN FRANCISCO--( BUSINESS WIRE )--NATIONAL PLAINTIFFS LAW FIRM LIEFF CABRASER HEIMANN & BERNSTEIN, LLP RECOMMENDS THAT GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. (“GENERAC” OR THE “COMPANY”) INVESTORS WHO SUFFERED LOSSES FROM PURCHASING OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRING GENERAC COMMON STOCK (NYSE: GNRC) BETWEEN APRIL 29, 2021 AND NOVEMBER 1, 2022 CONTACT OUR ATTORNEYS IMMEDIATELY REGARDING PENDING SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION AGAINST GENERAC. THE DEADLINE TO APPLY TO BE A LEAD PLAINTIFF IS JANUARY 30, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2022-12-07 13:00:00', 'title': 'GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP, A LEADING SECURITIES FRAUD LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES THE FILING OF A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION ON BEHALF OF GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. (GNRC) INVESTORS', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES--( BUSINESS WIRE )--GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP (“GPM”), A LEADING NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. (“GENERAC” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: GNRC) COMMON STOCK BETWEEN APRIL 29, 2021 AND NOVEMBER 1, 2022, INCLUSIVE (THE “CLASS PERIOD”). GENERAC INVESTORS HAVE UNTIL JANUARY 30, 2023 TO FILE A LEAD PLAINTIFF MOTION.